cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this MCP server, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: CEDA CCI OpenSearch MCP Server
abstract: >-
  MCP server for searching and subsetting CEDA CCI datasets. It finds Climate
  Change Initiative datasets for an essential climate variable, selects
  OPeNDAP files by date, and returns a point or bounding-box subset as JSON
  records.
authors:
